! The machinery case for P27 x P26: bilayer graphene put through the
! third-derivative path (`pypresso/response/electrostriction.py`), which is what
! the D2 phase could not run on a `smearing` input.
!
! Three things make this input what it is, and the first two are the same pair
! `si-electrostriction.in` documents. The grid is **unshifted**, so it is closed
! under the point group and `nosym` is safe -- which matters more here than
! anywhere else, because the object being differentiated carries a field label
! and a strain label at once and there is no rank-3 average written for it. And
! it is deliberately **small and under-converged**: what is being checked is a
! set of identities, and both sides of every one of them share this basis and
! this k-set.
!
! The third is specific to graphene and is not a preference. Graphene is a
! **semimetal** -- its gap closes at K -- and the Sternheimer response here is
! the insulator one, which is refused for a metal rather than silently applied.
! A Gamma-centred n x n x 1 grid contains K = (1/3, 1/3, 0) exactly when 3
! divides n, so **2 x 2 x 1 avoids it**: the sample is Gamma and the three M
! points, every one of which has a 3.7 eV gap, and `occupations = 'fixed'`
! is then the truth about this k-set rather than an approximation to it.
!
! What that costs is the physics. A 2 x 2 x 1 bilayer is not graphene's band
! structure, and a slab in vacuum has no bulk dielectric constant at all -- the
! `epsilon` this case produces is a property of the supercell. The numbers to
! read from it are the *agreements*, not the values.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 4, celldm(1) = 4.6511, celldm(3) = 4.3, nat = 4, ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 30.0
    occupations = 'fixed'
    nosym = .true.
    noinv = .true.
    vdw_corr = 'grimme-d2'
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-12
    mixing_beta = 0.5
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 C  12.011  C.pbe-hgh.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (crystal)
 C 0.000000000000 0.000000000000 0.343000000000
 C 0.333333333333 0.666666666667 0.343000000000
 C 0.000000000000 0.000000000000 0.657000000000
 C 0.666666666667 0.333333333333 0.657000000000
K_POINTS (automatic)
 2 2 1 0 0 0
